{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1475049","title":"Metatranscriptome from Aerobic Granular Sludge sampled at different reactor depths","description":"Aerobic Granular Sludge (AGS) biomass samples were collected from a full-scale AGS wastewater treatment plant (WWTP) in Utrecht, The Netherlands. Sampling was conducted at depths of 0.5 m (Bottom) and 4.5 m (Top) from reactor bottom, with triplicates taken for each depth during both anaerobic and aerobic phases. Each sample was further sieved into four microbial aggregate size fractions: flocs (0-200 um), small granules (200-500 um), medium granules (500-1000 um), and large granules (>1000 um), resulting in 48 final samples.","center":"King Abdullah University of Science and Technology (KAUST)","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2026/06/04 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN60628196","AGS from full-scale WWTP Utrecht_AN_LG_1_RNA","confirmed_urban","municipal_wastewater","2023-11-22",2023,"NL","Utrecht",2745912,"Utrecht","verified",52.0907,5.1214,"Netherlands: Utrecht","aerobic granular sludge from full-scale wastewater treatment plant",null,null,null,"named urban infrastructure at sample level"],["SAMN60628197","AGS from full-scale WWTP Utrecht_AN_MG_1_RNA","confirmed_urban","municipal_wastewater","2023-11-22",2023,"NL","Utrecht",2745912,"Utrecht","verified",52.0907,5.1214,"Netherlands: Utrecht","aerobic granular sludge from full-scale wastewater treatment plant",null,null,null,"named urban infrastructure at sample level"],["SAMN60628198","AGS from full-scale WWTP Utrecht_AN_SG_1_RNA","confirmed_urban","municipal_wastewater","2023-11-22",2023,"NL","Utrecht",2745912,"Utrecht","verified",52.0907,5.1214,"Netherlands: Utrecht","aerobic granular sludge from full-s